      "content": "i did that but they just give me these scripted, vague answers and pretend like nothing is wrong. it's so obvious they're stalling. like, they aren't actually helping, they're just trying to exhaust me so i'll just give up and move my money elsewhere. i don't think talking to them is going to work because they're the ones doing it. are there any ways to move my funds or set up \"defensive\" accounts that they can't easily interfere with or flag? i need to stay one step ahead of them.",
